    {
      "id": "claim_6ed98109de184de0944cc9710df96ef8",
      "statement": "Schema tables group into users/roles (users, drivers), fleet (trucks, trailers, tires, tire_positions, vehicle_schedules), catalogs (customers, routes, cargo_types, pricing_tables, road_allowances, fuel_config, fuel_price_history, penalty_reasons, management_fees, road_config, app_settings), suppliers/expenses, trips plus legs/fuel allocations/containers/seals/instructions/expenses/photos, forwarder flow (forwarder_expense_types, container_types, seal_types, ports, advance_requests, advance_settlements, advance_settlement_requests, settlement_expenses), ledger + receivables (ledger, debt_offsets, billing_documents, billing_document_lines, debit_note_templates), distribution + salary, audit + infra (audit_logs, trip_code_counters), GPS read models (route_polylines, trip_gps_tracks, vehicle_last_positions), agent/chatbot tables (agent_conversations, agent_messages, agent_turn_metrics, faq_entries, knowledge_chunks), and notifications + push_subscriptions. company_info is not a table — it is company.* key/value rows in app_settings assembled by company-info.service.ts; vehicle alerts and payables are likewise computed/derived, not stored.",
