    {
      "id": "claim_be5d685933fe42f7bcc9c231d9a296a6",
      "statement": "Notable schema conventions: TEXT + CHECK is used for enum-like values that would be costly as pgEnums — truck_cap_table.role is TEXT with truck_cap_role_check IN ('INVESTOR','DRIVER') (schema.ts:572-578), avoiding enum-migration cost and the name collision with the user-role pgEnum; single-default flags (salary_periods.isDefault, debit_note_templates.isDefault) are plain booleans whose exactly-one invariant is enforced transactionally in route handlers, not by a partial unique index; and pgvector vector(1536) columns for FAQ/knowledge embeddings are declared via the vectorColumn1536 customType helper (schema.ts:15-20).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/src/db/schema.ts#L15-L20",
