      "statement": "Migration 0116_reclassify_two_point_road_allowance.sql is an idempotent data migration: it folds two_point_delivery_bonus into total_road_allowance for OWN, non-canceled trips whose total still equals the old formula, so re-running skips already-reclassified rows; total_cost and gross_profit are intentionally unchanged because it moves money between components rather than adding cost.",
