      "id": "claim_8be5970ceb6f4e88bae32dceb9f4de27",
      "statement": "Migration 0062_billing_documents.sql introduces billing_documents and billing_document_lines for debit notes (DEBIT_NOTE) and payment statements (PAYMENT_STATEMENT): documents carry a frozen debitNoteTemplateSnapshot jsonb so historical documents re-render identically after template edits/deletes, and a separate ledger_adjustment_amount so an edit posts only the difference and repeated saves stay idempotent. A partial unique index (billing_documents_active_period_unique, WHERE deleted_at IS NULL AND type = 'DEBIT_NOTE') enforces one active debit note per entity+period.",
